{"type":"text","timestamp":1790356832784,"sessionID":"ses_f266d19f7ffeho3V5GvUKvMjj5","part":{"id":"prt_0d99541f10011WTq6Jznrbaijh","messageID":"msg_0d994dfcb001pBxsciDLlBv7c7","sessionID":"ses_f266d19f7ffeho3V5GvUKvMjj5","type":"text","text":"The scene renders correctly with all eight audio files in a centered two-column grid and the top bar showing 8 available streams and an empty queue. Godot 4.4.1 loaded it without script errors. I’m checking that button presses enqueue the correct paths and that both counters update during playback.","time":{"start":1790356832754,"end":1790356832757},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0d09dd1d369435cc016ab6ad5015288193a3328b6e28aa2643","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790356832784,"sessionID":"ses_f266d19f7ffeho3V5GvUKvMjj5","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_lxRBJboSYJJW66uXzxAQzO1x","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /workspace/.godot/verify_audio_demo.gd\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\tcall_deferred(\"verify\")\n+\n+\n+func verify() -> void:\n+\tvar manager = root.get_node(\"AudioManager\")\n+\tmanager.set_process(false)\n+\tvar demo = load(\"res://scenes/audio_demo.tscn\").instantiate()\n+\troot.add_child(demo)\n+\tvar grid = demo.get_node(\"CenterContainer/GridContainer\")\n+\tassert(grid.get_child_count() == 8, \"Expected one button per audio file\")\n+\tfor button in grid.get_children():\n+\t\tbutton.pressed.emit()\n+\t\tassert(manager.queue.back() == \"res://assets/\" + button.text)\n+\tgrid.get_child(0).pressed.emit()\n+\tdemo._process(0.0)\n+\tassert(demo.get_node(\"CanvasLayer/HBoxContainer/Label2\").text == \"8\")\n+\tassert(demo.get_node(\"CanvasLayer/HBoxContainer/Label3\").text == \"9\")\n+\tfor index in range(8):\n+\t\tmanager._process(0.0)\n+\tdemo._process(0.0)\n+\tassert(demo.get_node(\"CanvasLayer/HBoxContainer/Label2\").text == \"0\")\n+\tassert(demo.get_node(\"CanvasLayer/HBoxContainer/Label3\").text == \"1\")\n+\tfor player in manager.get_children():\n+\t\tassert(player.stream != null, \"Each audio file should load for playback\")\n+\t\tplayer.stop()\n+\t\tmanager.on_stream_finished(player)\n+\tmanager.queue.clear()\n+\tdemo._process(0.0)\n+\tassert(demo.get_node(\"CanvasLayer/HBoxContainer/Label2\").text == \"8\")\n+\tassert(demo.get_node(\"CanvasLayer/HBoxContainer/Label3\").text == \"0\")\n+\tprint(\"PASS: eight buttons enqueue correct paths, all streams load, counters track queue and pool changes.\")\n+\tquit()\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA workspace/.godot/verify_audio_demo.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/.godot/verify_audio_d